================================================================================
Image model
================================================================================

Image generation in Caracat AI is based on Z-Image-Turbo by Tongyi-MAI.

    Upstream model    Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo
    Upstream URL      https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo
    Upstream license  Apache License 2.0, as shown on the Hugging Face model
                      page. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for how this was
                      verified, and for the one question left open there.

Pictures are made by that model. They are not made by Caracat AI, which is a
language model and cannot make one, and not by this project. The interface
names the model beside every picture it shows, for the same reason each
assistant carries its base model's name: a picture appearing without one would
credit this project with someone else's work.

There are no weights here, and nothing of Tongyi-MAI's is redistributed. Any
copyright notices, license notices, NOTICE files and attribution information
distributed with the upstream model must be preserved in every redistribution
of that material, including redistribution in modified form, as required by the
Apache License 2.0.

